- `winhttp_dl.rs::try_large_page_alloc_and_copy` → calls **T-004 PEB Walker** via `crate::resolve::compute_hash()` for DJB2-hashed NT API name resolution
- `winhttp_dl.rs::NtVecBuf::Drop` → calls **T-001 RecycledGate** for `NtFreeVirtualMemory`
- `winhttp_dl.rs::load_payload_fsm` → references **T-022 Architecture** via `crate::fsm::ExecutionContext` and `crate::payload_cfg::PAYLOAD` (compile-time embedded payload, T-021 obfuscation pattern)
- `eth_rpc.rs::sign_and_send` → calls **T-021 Crypto & Obfuscation** via `crate::eth_tx::sign_transaction(nonce, gas_price, gas_limit, to, 0, calldata, private_key, chain_id)` — the pure-Rust EIP-155 signer
- `vnc_server.rs::vnc_capture_loop` → calls **T-023 Client Capabilities** via `crate::capture::capture_jpeg(monitor_index, jpeg_quality)` and `crate::capture::ScreenCapturer`
- `vnc_server.rs::handle_pointer_event` → calls **T-023 Client Capabilities** via `crate::input::move_mouse_normalized` and `crate::input::scroll_wheel`
- `vnc_server.rs::handle_client_cut_text` → calls **T-023 Client Capabilities** via `crate::clipboard::set_clipboard`
- `vnc_server.rs::vnc_server_task` → calls **T-023 Client Capabilities** via `crate::sysinfo_collect::get_monitor_rect(monitor_index)` for framebuffer dimensions
